<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team about your recent flight {{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
We want your journey with us to be seamless from start to finish, so I’m sorry to hear about your disappointment on departure from {{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Navigating our Check-in process</strong><br />
<br />
We appreciate that our Check-in kiosks and Auto Bag drops are a change to your check-in experience.<br />
<br />
We can assure you we will be heightening the focus of our Qantas Ground Hosts to proactively engage with our customers, as they check-in this way.<br />
<br />
Their visibility and presence should help you as you move through the check-in experience, so I’m sorry to find out that wasn’t the case.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service every time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed on your feedback to Airport Management, where they can work to improve this aspect of our service in future.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience <b>—</b>&nbsp;we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
